@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title GET /api/workspace/v1/messenger/folders/
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
Client -> API: 查询
note right of API
  目前的实现: page_limit 没有/0 => 没有限制
  负数/不准数 => 400; 没有上限/极限的正值
  Target: 没有/0 => 100; 1..500 确实是这样; 否则 400; unlimited 没有
end note
API -> DB: 已被索引 SELECT
note right of DB
  FOLDER 保存一次; USER_FOLDER_BINDING 保存访问,
  计数器和 read-only JSONB folder_items_snapshot; empty=[]
  每一个 folder row 准备好了: 没有 N+1/json_agg/COUNT/custom SQL
  系统文件规则/类型已固定; API 没有使用索引连接 COUNT
  自动 FOLDER_ITEM: 活跃的 USER_STREAM_BINDING + 规范性 STREAM.is_archived = false
  All chats = 所有的; Personal = STREAM.private = true; Channels = STREAM.private = false
  Snapshot 确定性支持 folder_projection.
end note
DB --> API: indexed page 没有 ready snapshots/counts
note right of API: 没有 outbox / 任务 / 事件
API --> Client: 200 JSON
@enduml
